-- Tests for pc-body-b-deferred.l4: Penal Code 1871, Chapter 16, ss 372, 373, 373A,
-- 376B to 376H, 377 and 377B, completed in the pass of 2026-11-04.
--
-- Where the expected values come from.
--
-- * The structural cases (the first part of each section's tests) are generated
--   by generators/deferred/gen_struct_tests.py from the elements each section's
--   spec lists, which were written from the Code's words: for each offence, a
--   set of facts that meets every element (one set per alternative of an "or"),
--   one set per element with that element alone made untrue, and a set with
--   nothing established.  The expected values are not read from any output:
--   an offence is made out exactly when every element is, the charge states
--   the section, the offence's name and the punishment words copied from the
--   Code, and when it is not made out the charge has no text and a refusal.
--   What they test is that the L4 says what the spec says.  They cannot find a
--   spec that misreads the text.
-- * The cases written by hand (the second part of each section) are the ones
--   the structure cannot give: the Explanations, the closed lists, the rules
--   of reading, the offences defined over another offence's facts, and the
--   exact words of a charge.  Each cites the subsection it tests.
-- * A failing assertion is a finding.  None has been edited to match the code.
-- By one Sonnet 5.5 agent, 2026-11-04.  The text is the converter's plain-text rendering of Singapore Statutes Online ("Current version as at 09 Sep 2026"), not the official text.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `pc-domain`
IMPORT `pc-general`
IMPORT `pc-body-b-kidnapping`
IMPORT `pc-body-b-sexual`
IMPORT `pc-body-b-deferred`

§ `body-b deferred tests`

`the particulars` MEANS Particulars WITH
    accused            IS "Tan Ah Kow"
    date               IS "the 1st day of March 2025"
    time               IS "9.30 pm"
    place              IS "Block 123 Ang Mo Kio Avenue 3"
    `co-accused`       IS ""
    `common intention` IS FALSE

`the victim` MEANS Person WITH
    name           IS "Lim Mei Ling"
    `described as` IS ""
    pronoun        IS she
    kind           IS `a human being`

